# "A single creature you control" is a permanent (CR 110.2, 109.4). Bot1's Bolt at its own Llanowar Elves is copied (the copy goes to Bot2) and
# kills the Elves; the Reanimate that then targets the Elves card in Bot1's graveyard is alone on the stack.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Resonance
Forest
Mountain
Swamp
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Reanimate
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Stack.Count = 2
